<title>FRANCE: Franc stability goal achieved in 96 - BoF's Trichet.</title>
<headline>Franc stability goal achieved in 96 - BoF's Trichet.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France governor Jean-Claude Trichet said on Tuesday that the objective of franc stability versus other key EU currencies in 1996 had been achieved.</p>
<p>&quot;The objective of external stability of the franc versus the most credible currencies in the European exchange rate mechanism was also achieved,&quot; Trichet said.</p>
<p>&quot;Since the start of 1996 the franc has continued to gradually approach its pivot rate versus the other currencies, he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
